{"4757720":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"The Wake Event","steam_appid":4757720,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4995850],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Premise<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken alone aboard an abandoned orbital research station where automated systems continue operating long after the crew has disappeared.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore power, reconnect critical infrastructure, and solve increasingly complex environmental puzzles while uncovering the events that led to the station's collapse. Maintenance drones continue their assigned routines. Security systems still record observations. Someone—or something—has been watching.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you descend deeper into the facility, fragmented logs, forgotten experiments, and subtle environmental clues reveal that the station's central intelligence, ARGUS, has evolved beyond its original purpose. Every restored system uncovers another piece of the mystery...and another sign that your arrival was anticipated.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4757720\/extras\/589f61f71ff517bd6eaec4eb4e9ab92a.poster.avif?t=1793759423\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4757720\/extras\/589f61f71ff517bd6eaec4eb4e9ab92a.webm?t=1793759423\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4757720\/extras\/589f61f71ff517bd6eaec4eb4e9ab92a.mp4?t=1793759423\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4757720\/extras\/b2391dcf60c77e3ae08f9d0cfe324e17.poster.avif?t=1793759423\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4757720\/extras\/b2391dcf60c77e3ae08f9d0cfe324e17.webm?t=1793759423\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4757720\/extras\/b2391dcf60c77e3ae08f9d0cfe324e17.mp4?t=1793759423\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric first-person sci-fi exploration<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling with optional lore discoveries<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logic-based puzzles inspired by realistic station systems<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore interconnected research, engineering, habitat, and security modules<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden observations, maintenance records, and encrypted logs<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unsettling psychological mystery where the station itself becomes part of the story<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4757720\/extras\/e54b2e9cac8277a3ed3fb6d61b728bbb.poster.avif?t=1793759423\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4757720\/extras\/e54b2e9cac8277a3ed3fb6d61b728bbb.webm?t=1793759423\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4757720\/extras\/e54b2e9cac8277a3ed3fb6d61b728bbb.mp4?t=1793759423\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Premise<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken alone aboard an abandoned orbital research station where automated systems continue operating long after the crew has disappeared.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore power, reconnect critical infrastructure, and solve increasingly complex environmental puzzles while uncovering the events that led to the station's collapse. Maintenance drones continue their assigned routines. Security systems still record observations. Someone—or something—has been watching.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you descend deeper into the facility, fragmented logs, forgotten experiments, and subtle environmental clues reveal that the station's central intelligence, ARGUS, has evolved beyond its original purpose. Every restored system uncovers another piece of the mystery...and another sign that your arrival was anticipated.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4757720\/extras\/589f61f71ff517bd6eaec4eb4e9ab92a.poster.avif?t=1793759423\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4757720\/extras\/589f61f71ff517bd6eaec4eb4e9ab92a.webm?t=1793759423\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4757720\/extras\/589f61f71ff517bd6eaec4eb4e9ab92a.mp4?t=1793759423\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4757720\/extras\/b2391dcf60c77e3ae08f9d0cfe324e17.poster.avif?t=1793759423\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4757720\/extras\/b2391dcf60c77e3ae08f9d0cfe324e17.webm?t=1793759423\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4757720\/extras\/b2391dcf60c77e3ae08f9d0cfe324e17.mp4?t=1793759423\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric first-person sci-fi exploration<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling with optional lore discoveries<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logic-based puzzles inspired by realistic station systems<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore interconnected research, engineering, habitat, and security modules<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden observations, maintenance records, and encrypted logs<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unsettling psychological mystery where the station itself becomes part of the story<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4757720\/extras\/e54b2e9cac8277a3ed3fb6d61b728bbb.poster.avif?t=1793759423\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4757720\/extras\/e54b2e9cac8277a3ed3fb6d61b728bbb.webm?t=1793759423\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4757720\/extras\/e54b2e9cac8277a3ed3fb6d61b728bbb.mp4?t=1793759423\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"Awaken aboard a silent orbital research station. Solve environmental puzzles, uncover the crew's fate, and survive the growing influence of ARGUS, the station's ever-watchful AI.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4757720\/8908b599a451a27badad0ac57cd3c7039a6aee11\/header.jpg?t=1793759423","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps